package/rpi-firmware: bump to the 2026-05-21 build

The 2026.02 pin (063bcab6, VideoCore build 2026-12-08... dated Dec 8
2025) does not boot a Raspberry Pi 3 at all: bootcode.bin/start.elf
load, the ACT LED flickers for about a second, and the SoC parks with
no splash and no error pattern - on the very same card and board where
the 2026-05-21 build boots everything. Bench-bisected by swapping only
the bootcode.bin/start.elf/fixup.dat trio between images; the Pi 4
(EEPROM boot, start4.elf) was never affected.

495ed912a33f is the firmware commit whose start.elf is byte-identical
to the build proven on the bench (VC_BUILD_ID 288930ab, 2026-05-21,
shipped by RPi OS trixie).

Applied to the Buildroot tree by CI (see buildroot-patches/ and
.github/workflows/image.yml).

